stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> PENDING
 PENDING --> BLOCKED: missing required input/capability
 PENDING --> READY: preflight pass
 BLOCKED --> PENDING: reviewed input revision
 READY --> WAITING_APPROVAL: effect requires grant
 READY --> RUNNING: safe local node
 WAITING_APPROVAL --> RUNNING: persist intent + reserve + consume grant
 RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED: verified output
 RUNNING --> FAILED: known failure
 RUNNING --> UNKNOWN: dispatch outcome uncertain
 RUNNING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED: user asks cancel
 CANCEL_REQUESTED --> CANCELED: confirmed stop
 CANCEL_REQUESTED --> UNKNOWN: remote outcome uncertain
 CANCEL_REQUESTED --> SUCCEEDED: job finished before stop
 UNKNOWN --> SUCCEEDED: reconcile existing output
 UNKNOWN --> FAILED: proven known failure
 UNKNOWN --> CANCELED: confirmed provider cancellation
 SUCCEEDED --> [*]
 FAILED --> [*]
 CANCELED --> [*]
 note right of UNKNOWN: No automatic redispatch or release of reservation
